WEBVTT

01:35.910 --> 01:40.690
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.490 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 31]

01:45.560 --> 01:46.479
Zhuang Shen attempted to

01:46.479 --> 01:48.150
have Feng Suige assassinated
in the street,

01:48.150 --> 01:49.479
which ended in failure.

01:49.710 --> 01:52.120
Feng Suige then broke into
the Zhuang Residence,

01:52.120 --> 01:53.380
captured Zhuang Shen,

01:53.479 --> 01:55.479
and took him to the imperial palace.

01:56.509 --> 01:57.590
Zhuang Shen could be said

01:57.590 --> 01:59.250
as a relative of yours, right?

01:59.430 --> 02:00.690
My brother once told me

02:01.000 --> 02:03.790
Zhuang Shen was responsible
for our mother's death.

02:03.790 --> 02:05.250
That explains the enmity.

02:05.480 --> 02:07.480
Feng Suige killed Zhuang Shen
in the Susha imperial palace,

02:07.480 --> 02:08.750
in the presence of all.

02:09.080 --> 02:12.810
Then, the Zhuang family's property
was ordered to be confiscated.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.970
A powerful official was convicted

02:16.030 --> 02:17.800
of treason within just one day.

02:18.620 --> 02:20.470
Your brother was said to be
decisive and resolute.

02:20.470 --> 02:21.930
Indeed, how crafty of him.

02:22.870 --> 02:23.870
The next morning,

02:24.280 --> 02:25.940
Feng Suige slayed the Emperor

02:26.430 --> 02:27.490
alone with a sword,

02:28.310 --> 02:29.970
planning to usurp the throne.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.560
Give it to me! I'll read it myself!

02:36.560 --> 02:37.820
Feng Suige's atrocity

02:37.870 --> 02:39.130
was finally revealed.

02:39.430 --> 02:42.290
Murong Zhong and Murong Yao
executed him in the end.

02:48.360 --> 02:49.870
Are the investigators
you sent out for this matter

02:49.870 --> 02:50.590
reliable?

02:51.150 --> 02:51.750
What?

02:52.680 --> 02:53.870
You still don't believe it?

02:53.870 --> 02:54.310
Murong Yao

02:54.310 --> 02:55.970
was my brother's best friend.

02:56.030 --> 02:56.470
Murong Zhong

02:56.470 --> 02:57.820
was like an uncle to us,
as he watched us grow up.

02:57.820 --> 02:58.560
My brother was even closer to him

02:58.560 --> 02:59.620
than to our father!

02:59.680 --> 03:00.430
How could they have

03:00.430 --> 03:02.030
possibly killed my brother?

03:02.710 --> 03:04.190
Are there raging flames of fury

03:04.190 --> 03:05.670
in your heart now,

03:05.840 --> 03:06.310
amidst the confusion

03:06.310 --> 03:07.590
about who you should hate

03:07.590 --> 03:09.790
and who you should direct your anger to?

03:10.750 --> 03:12.150
I said it right, didn't I?

03:13.750 --> 03:14.600
Oh, you.

03:15.030 --> 03:15.760
How foolish!

03:15.840 --> 03:16.560
Why not just vent out

03:16.560 --> 03:17.890
the anger in your heart?

03:18.310 --> 03:19.000
Since you have no idea

03:19.000 --> 03:20.190
who you should take revenge on,

03:20.190 --> 03:21.680
just kill whoever you want!

03:21.680 --> 03:23.360
If you kill the wrong person, so be it.

03:23.360 --> 03:24.590
It's better than restraining yourself,
isn it?

03:24.590 --> 03:25.150
Can you find out

03:25.150 --> 03:26.410
who my enemy really is?

03:27.079 --> 03:28.480
One more investigation?

03:29.150 --> 03:29.840
Isn't everything

03:29.840 --> 03:31.470
written clearly in this report?

03:31.470 --> 03:32.910
It was Murong Zhong and his son

03:32.910 --> 03:34.310
who killed your father and brother.

03:34.310 --> 03:35.840
What more evidence do you need?

03:35.840 --> 03:37.400
Why care about if there are hidden truths?

03:37.400 --> 03:39.600
All will be over when I kill them for you!

03:40.079 --> 03:41.870
Your father already died.

03:42.630 --> 03:44.590
So did your brother.

03:43.490 --> 03:44.040
[Feng Suige's atrocity
was finally revealed]

03:44.070 --> 03:44.590
[Murong Zhong and Murong Yao
executed him in the end]

03:46.630 --> 03:49.360
They were killed
by Murong Zhong and his son.

03:50.680 --> 03:51.960
See for yourself!

04:00.150 --> 04:01.210
That's the spirit.

04:01.600 --> 04:03.390
I'm telling you, from now on,

04:03.630 --> 04:05.080
I disallow you to restrain yourself again.

04:05.080 --> 04:05.750
Life is about

04:05.750 --> 04:07.150
doing whatever you want.

04:07.240 --> 04:08.310
Curse whoever you want!

04:08.310 --> 04:09.490
Kill whoever you want!

04:09.490 --> 04:10.800
That's the way to please yourself!

04:10.800 --> 04:11.400
Get out!

04:12.000 --> 04:12.970
Get out of here!

04:13.080 --> 04:14.410
-Feng Xiyang!
-Get out!

04:15.240 --> 04:15.800
Scram!

04:15.800 --> 04:16.930
Feng Xiyang, you...

04:19.800 --> 04:20.360
You...

04:55.310 --> 04:56.200
Have some more

04:56.390 --> 04:57.920
snacks and cakes delivered

04:58.070 --> 04:59.070
to Prince Xiyang.

04:59.270 --> 05:00.530
Make them look pretty.

05:01.390 --> 05:02.720
That might cheer her up.

05:05.040 --> 05:05.950
What are you waiting for?

05:05.950 --> 05:06.750
Go get it done!

05:07.310 --> 05:07.750
Yes.

05:23.720 --> 05:25.000
Our biggest concern

05:26.270 --> 05:27.400
has become reality.

05:33.870 --> 05:35.950
His eyes are cured
with Lady An's treatment,

05:35.950 --> 05:37.870
indicating that the blood clots
in his brain have resolved.

05:37.870 --> 05:38.870
That's good news.

05:39.310 --> 05:40.630
I thought the worst scenario would be

05:40.630 --> 05:42.159
he losing all the memories,

05:42.190 --> 05:44.430
but the real situation
is unexpectedly worse.

05:44.430 --> 05:46.090
He does remember some things.

05:46.680 --> 05:48.270
But he thinks of you as an enemy,

05:48.270 --> 05:50.360
forgetting all the good things about you.

05:50.360 --> 05:51.159
Is it possible

05:51.270 --> 05:53.330
to help him recover all the memories?

05:55.240 --> 05:57.190
You heard what Lady An said, didn't you?

05:57.190 --> 05:58.270
The brain

05:58.310 --> 05:59.770
is incredibly intricate.

06:00.240 --> 06:01.160
No one can tell if he can

06:01.160 --> 06:02.760
recollect all the memories.

06:04.390 --> 06:05.260
Enough.

06:05.310 --> 06:06.770
Let's not leave it to fate.

06:07.360 --> 06:08.030
Miss Yixiao,

06:08.030 --> 06:09.230
don't worry too much.

06:09.240 --> 06:10.510
When His Highness wakes up,

06:10.510 --> 06:11.270
I'll tell him everything,

06:11.270 --> 06:12.510
even if I have to pin him down.

06:12.510 --> 06:13.970
Great. That's a good idea.

06:14.160 --> 06:14.920
See,

06:14.950 --> 06:16.390
you know best about their story.

06:16.390 --> 06:16.800
Yeah.

06:16.800 --> 06:17.750
Telling it to him in detail

06:17.750 --> 06:18.750
will help to jog his memory.

06:18.750 --> 06:19.280
Exactly!

06:19.360 --> 06:19.920
Kiddo,

06:20.830 --> 06:21.630
Lu Ke is right.

06:21.630 --> 06:22.600
Just don't worry.

06:22.600 --> 06:24.120
Suige's mind is a mess now.

06:24.310 --> 06:25.800
Whatever he says or does,

06:26.240 --> 06:27.600
don't take it to heart.

06:28.680 --> 06:29.480
I'm fine.

06:29.950 --> 06:30.720
Don't worry.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.490
I'm mentally prepared.

06:33.600 --> 06:34.360
At least,

06:34.720 --> 06:36.050
his life has been saved.

06:36.720 --> 06:37.430
At least,

06:37.870 --> 06:39.270
he can see now.

06:40.430 --> 06:41.070
At least,

06:41.950 --> 06:43.310
unlike me in the past,

06:44.159 --> 06:45.600
he still knows who he is.

06:46.159 --> 06:46.830
Alright.

06:47.680 --> 06:48.680
Say no more.

06:49.040 --> 06:50.040
I'll go talk to Lady An.

06:50.040 --> 06:51.700
I'll beg her to work out a plan.

06:53.950 --> 06:54.920
I heard

06:55.310 --> 06:56.510
Feng Suige had come to.

06:56.510 --> 06:57.909
He did wake up from a coma,

06:59.870 --> 07:01.480
but his condition is complex.

07:01.480 --> 07:02.610
I'll go find Lady An.

07:14.430 --> 07:15.310
Today, I'm here

07:16.430 --> 07:17.830
to deliver you a message.

07:18.390 --> 07:19.720
I've made some inquiries.

07:19.720 --> 07:21.250
Rumor has it in Yujing City

07:21.630 --> 07:23.390
that Feng Suige killed the Emperor

07:23.390 --> 07:24.830
and was then executed by the Murong family

07:24.830 --> 07:27.160
in the name of defending the sovereignty.

07:27.430 --> 07:28.270
That is to say,

07:28.750 --> 07:30.000
nobody but us knows

07:30.240 --> 07:31.700
Feng Suige is still alive.

07:32.680 --> 07:34.140
The Second Prince of Susha

07:34.680 --> 07:36.540
has already ascended the throne.

07:47.280 --> 07:49.350
[In Storm Alliance on Wufeng Mountain]

08:06.240 --> 08:07.100
Your Highness,

08:07.360 --> 08:08.490
you finally woke up!

08:12.040 --> 08:13.510
I meant it when I said I could wake him up

08:13.510 --> 08:14.800
by putting a needle in only one acupoint.

08:14.800 --> 08:15.800
Impressive.

08:18.120 --> 08:19.250
How are you feeling?

08:21.240 --> 08:22.570
Do you remember who I am?

08:23.560 --> 08:24.420
What about him?

08:25.510 --> 08:26.510
You're Lord Ling.

08:29.190 --> 08:30.000
He is Lu Ke.

08:31.270 --> 08:31.950
Terrific.

08:38.960 --> 08:40.289
What's going on with me?

08:41.600 --> 08:42.549
Where am I?

08:43.789 --> 08:44.670
I can't explain to you

08:44.670 --> 08:45.870
the whole thing right now.

08:45.870 --> 08:46.870
Just remember this:

08:46.870 --> 08:48.600
you escaped death not long ago.

08:48.600 --> 08:49.790
You need a good rest now.

08:49.790 --> 08:51.030
Don't ask any questions.

08:51.030 --> 08:51.720
Lu Ke,

08:52.440 --> 08:54.500
have we conquered Pingling City yet?

09:00.080 --> 09:00.630
What?

09:03.150 --> 09:04.440
Please try thinking of a way

09:04.440 --> 09:05.630
to help him recover

09:05.630 --> 09:06.630
more memories.

09:07.840 --> 09:09.000
What do you mean?

09:09.270 --> 09:10.800
What are you talking about?

09:10.870 --> 09:12.600
Try figuring out a way, please.

09:12.600 --> 09:13.440
Yeah.

09:15.960 --> 09:16.910
But I...

09:20.320 --> 09:22.910
Fu Yixiao...

09:26.000 --> 09:27.360
I'm going to kill you!

09:28.240 --> 09:29.130
No, no!

09:29.550 --> 09:30.600
Calm down.

09:30.720 --> 09:31.910
Calm down, Your Highness.

09:31.910 --> 09:34.110
-Listen to me...
-You have to leave now!

09:34.120 --> 09:35.270
You need a good rest now.

09:35.270 --> 09:36.490
Get some rest!

09:37.550 --> 09:38.360
See?

09:38.630 --> 09:39.630
Calm down.

09:40.320 --> 09:41.790
Are you alright, Your Highness?

09:41.790 --> 09:42.840
Take a breath.

09:44.080 --> 09:45.080
Stay calm.

09:48.320 --> 09:49.080
Let's go.

09:50.390 --> 09:51.320
Move it!

10:01.150 --> 10:02.810
I know you're hurting inside.

10:03.080 --> 10:04.550
If you're really that upset,

10:04.550 --> 10:05.670
cry it out.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.530
It'll make you feel better.

10:08.390 --> 10:10.200
How can anyone take this?

10:10.480 --> 10:11.150
A once

10:11.440 --> 10:12.720
loving couple

10:12.840 --> 10:13.670
has become

10:13.750 --> 10:14.840
mortal enemies.

10:19.270 --> 10:20.030
You're saying

10:20.030 --> 10:21.790
she's my dearest and beloved one?

10:21.790 --> 10:22.990
How is that possible?

10:23.080 --> 10:23.940
Your Highness,

10:24.870 --> 10:26.440
why would I ever lie to you?

10:26.480 --> 10:28.880
She really is. You've just forgotten that.

10:31.320 --> 10:33.080
Due to severe physical trauma

10:33.480 --> 10:34.530
and prolonged suffocation,

10:34.530 --> 10:35.960
there were blood clots in your brain,

10:35.960 --> 10:37.560
which caused you blindness.

10:37.630 --> 10:39.200
Lady An made the clots go away

10:39.200 --> 10:40.320
and fixed your eyes

10:40.360 --> 10:42.020
with the Golden Acupuncture.

10:42.150 --> 10:43.010
But meanwhile,

10:43.320 --> 10:44.720
you lost some memories,

10:44.960 --> 10:46.200
and your mind was disturbed.

10:46.200 --> 10:47.630
That's why when you saw Fu Yixiao,

10:47.630 --> 10:49.120
you behaved
completely different than usual,

10:49.120 --> 10:51.920
and felt irritable, agitated,
and out of control.

11:02.080 --> 11:03.940
Then how do you explain this scar?

11:05.480 --> 11:07.010
When she shot an arrow at me,

11:07.150 --> 11:08.750
she clearly meant to kill me!

11:11.440 --> 11:12.440
This is an attack

11:14.000 --> 11:16.120
I will never forget.

11:18.360 --> 11:19.360
That arrow attack

11:19.510 --> 11:21.600
is the most indelible memory in his mind?

11:21.600 --> 11:22.360
Exactly.

11:22.600 --> 11:24.270
I guess that's the reason.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.440
He can't remember

11:25.510 --> 11:28.080
what happened
after the Battle of Pingling,

11:28.390 --> 11:29.960
when you shot that arrow

11:29.960 --> 11:30.840
at him.

11:32.360 --> 11:33.160
Nonetheless,

11:33.390 --> 11:35.240
perhaps this is destiny.

11:35.510 --> 11:36.600
If it weren't for this arrow

11:36.600 --> 11:37.870
that changed you two's lives,

11:37.870 --> 11:38.630
he might've

11:38.630 --> 11:40.030
forgotten everything by now,

11:40.030 --> 11:42.120
and the situation would've become worse.

11:42.120 --> 11:44.000
If he had lost all the memories,

11:44.030 --> 11:45.390
it would be even harder

11:45.440 --> 11:46.790
for him to recover them.

11:46.840 --> 11:48.240
I've seen

11:48.270 --> 11:49.610
many similar cases.

11:49.750 --> 11:51.630
He'd be too stubborn

11:51.630 --> 11:53.580
to take anyone's advice

11:53.670 --> 11:55.080
or to trust anyone.

11:55.320 --> 11:56.270
How can you even not

11:56.270 --> 11:57.270
believe my words?

11:57.960 --> 12:00.160
How am I supposed to believe all of this?

12:01.320 --> 12:02.790
If it's really as you say—

12:03.240 --> 12:04.640
that I've lost memories,

12:05.440 --> 12:06.120
then what should I do

12:06.120 --> 12:07.320
to get them back?

12:08.030 --> 12:09.090
You must leave him.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.390
All you can do now

12:18.480 --> 12:19.960
is leave him.

12:20.240 --> 12:22.200
You have to disappear from his life,

12:22.200 --> 12:23.440
and to never see him again.

12:23.440 --> 12:25.270
Don't show your face either.

12:25.440 --> 12:27.370
Just let him gradually forget you.

12:27.720 --> 12:28.480
Give him time

12:28.630 --> 12:30.000
for a full recovery.

12:30.120 --> 12:31.320
Can you do that?

12:32.790 --> 12:33.390
Well...

12:34.270 --> 12:35.670
How long do I need to wait?

12:35.910 --> 12:37.040
Three or five years.

12:37.240 --> 12:38.200
Maybe a decade.

12:38.360 --> 12:40.000
It could also be a lifetime.

12:46.600 --> 12:47.320
There's nothing

12:47.320 --> 12:48.980
we can say to convince you now.

12:49.150 --> 12:49.750
Forget it.

12:50.360 --> 12:51.690
We can't rush anything.

12:52.150 --> 12:52.750
Listen,

12:53.320 --> 12:54.870
just focus on recuperating.

12:54.870 --> 12:55.790
When you recover,

12:55.790 --> 12:57.450
we'll resume the discussion.

12:58.630 --> 12:59.910
I want to meet with Fu Yixiao.

12:59.910 --> 13:00.440
What?

13:00.840 --> 13:01.750
Why meet with her?

13:01.750 --> 13:03.350
Do you still want to kill her?

13:03.670 --> 13:05.200
I want to know the truth.

13:07.600 --> 13:08.870
Fine. The truth is as follows.

13:08.870 --> 13:09.790
In order to save your life,

13:09.790 --> 13:10.480
Fu Yixiao gathered us

13:10.480 --> 13:11.480
and went to a lot of trouble

13:11.480 --> 13:12.840
in the past many days.

13:13.320 --> 13:14.240
I'm telling you,

13:14.240 --> 13:15.150
only when you recall who she really is

13:15.150 --> 13:16.070
can you go meet her.

13:16.070 --> 13:17.480
Otherwise, just don't see her again.

13:17.480 --> 13:18.550
If it takes you a lifetime
to figure it out,

13:18.550 --> 13:20.680
then stay away from her for a lifetime!

13:26.910 --> 13:28.320
How long do you mean

13:29.120 --> 13:30.150
by "a lifetime"?

13:32.320 --> 13:33.910
Don't you understand?

13:34.320 --> 13:36.510
Sometimes it's better not to see

13:36.790 --> 13:38.910
or have feelings for someone.

13:40.030 --> 13:41.120
Your affection for him

13:41.120 --> 13:42.360
is like a sword.

13:42.510 --> 13:44.670
The closer you are to him,
the deeper the sword sticks into him.

13:44.670 --> 13:46.240
When your wishes are all fulfilled,

13:46.240 --> 13:47.770
he'll be covered in wounds.

13:53.550 --> 13:55.020
But if I leave him...

13:55.120 --> 13:56.790
You'll feel physically
and emotionally hurt,

13:56.790 --> 13:58.450
while he'll be safe and sound.

14:40.320 --> 14:40.960
Emperor.

14:42.000 --> 14:43.060
What are you doing?

14:43.510 --> 14:44.510
Picking flowers.

14:44.630 --> 14:46.080
Can't you see that, Mother?

14:46.080 --> 14:47.080
Picking flowers?

14:48.240 --> 14:49.240
What else can I do?

14:50.550 --> 14:51.960
The weather is nice today.

14:51.960 --> 14:53.270
Can't I take a walk outside?

14:53.270 --> 14:55.070
Aren't you out here too, Mother?

14:55.910 --> 14:57.610
You could've asked others

14:57.790 --> 14:59.450
to pick the flowers you liked.

15:00.390 --> 15:01.870
How can you do it yourself?

15:02.630 --> 15:03.200
Mother,

15:04.080 --> 15:05.000
it never occurred to me

15:05.000 --> 15:06.060
until this very day

15:06.240 --> 15:07.240
that some flowers

15:07.550 --> 15:08.790
must be picked by myself,

15:08.790 --> 15:10.190
or there wouldn't be fun.

15:14.760 --> 15:16.600
Some flowers may look gorgeous,

15:17.150 --> 15:18.550
but they wither quickly.

15:19.200 --> 15:20.030
When that happens,

15:20.030 --> 15:21.360
their colors will fade,

15:22.080 --> 15:24.280
leaving only poisonous thorns behind.

15:25.320 --> 15:26.890
It hurts to be pricked.

15:27.390 --> 15:28.600
I've long grown accustomed

15:28.600 --> 15:29.910
to thornless flowers.

15:31.080 --> 15:32.430
It feels nice...

15:34.670 --> 15:35.480
to be pricked.

15:37.790 --> 15:39.190
I've warned you

15:39.320 --> 15:40.510
not to go rogue

15:40.960 --> 15:42.390
or to hit on Feng Xiyang.

15:44.280 --> 15:45.450
Go rogue?

15:46.840 --> 15:48.640
It's true that you're my mother,

15:48.870 --> 15:50.400
but I am the Emperor!

15:50.630 --> 15:52.290
I know exactly what I'm doing.

16:47.200 --> 16:49.800
You grew with the tree,
sharing the same roots.

16:50.510 --> 16:51.790
But eventually,

16:52.360 --> 16:54.090
you would detach from the tree.

16:55.600 --> 16:57.260
As it thrives and flourishes,

16:58.270 --> 16:59.870
you would travel far away.

17:03.030 --> 17:04.030
Perhaps

17:05.240 --> 17:06.400
this is the fate

17:06.400 --> 17:07.660
I can't escape either.

17:17.550 --> 17:18.510
All you can do now

17:18.680 --> 17:20.089
is leave him.

17:20.200 --> 17:22.640
You have to disappear from his life,

17:22.690 --> 17:24.060
and to never see him again.

17:22.819 --> 17:25.150
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

17:24.200 --> 17:26.190
Don't show your face either.

17:25.730 --> 17:28.440
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

17:26.400 --> 17:28.550
Just let him gradually forget you.

17:28.910 --> 17:31.250
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

17:29.000 --> 17:30.870
Give him time for a full recovery.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.310
Can you do that?

17:31.710 --> 17:35.080
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

17:35.630 --> 17:37.780
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

17:38.220 --> 17:41.650
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

17:39.790 --> 17:41.190
Can you make me a promise?

17:41.400 --> 17:43.000
If I ever forget you,

17:42.360 --> 17:48.010
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

17:44.110 --> 17:45.400
be mad at me, beat me,

17:45.400 --> 17:46.800
and yell at me as you like.

17:47.920 --> 17:49.440
But please don't be disappointed in me.

17:48.430 --> 17:50.290
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

17:50.680 --> 17:51.680
And definitely don't leave me

17:50.780 --> 17:54.680
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

17:51.680 --> 17:53.280
because of disappointment,

17:54.440 --> 17:55.030
will you?

17:54.970 --> 17:56.720
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

17:57.220 --> 18:01.020
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

18:01.520 --> 18:03.450
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

18:03.830 --> 18:06.900
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

18:07.610 --> 18:12.730
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

18:10.590 --> 18:11.590
I've promised

18:12.680 --> 18:14.240
to never leave you.

18:16.710 --> 18:19.330
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

18:23.310 --> 18:25.780
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

18:36.270 --> 18:37.070
Miss Yixiao.

18:38.550 --> 18:41.350
I tried explaining
to His Highness just now,

18:41.350 --> 18:42.610
but he wouldn't listen

18:43.070 --> 18:44.240
and he drove me away.

18:45.790 --> 18:46.680
He's still

18:46.680 --> 18:47.880
quite weak right now.

18:48.070 --> 18:49.800
He has probably fallen asleep.

18:50.400 --> 18:52.000
I'm still worried about him.

18:53.200 --> 18:55.600
Does he recall
what happened to his father?

18:56.680 --> 18:57.750
He can't remember anything that happened

18:57.750 --> 18:59.410
after the Battle of Pingling.

19:01.240 --> 19:03.640
He's forgotten the most painful memories.

19:03.720 --> 19:04.440
I wonder

19:05.160 --> 19:06.890
if it's a blessing in disguise.

19:08.750 --> 19:09.720
Don't worry too much,

19:09.720 --> 19:10.450
Miss Yixiao.

19:11.350 --> 19:12.640
Elder Zhou and Lord Ling

19:12.640 --> 19:13.770
are now considering

19:13.830 --> 19:14.680
if there are better ways

19:14.680 --> 19:16.000
to jog His Highness's memory.

19:16.000 --> 19:17.110
If we're out of options,

19:17.110 --> 19:18.000
I'll spill everything

19:18.000 --> 19:19.070
at the risk of infuriating His Highness.

19:19.070 --> 19:19.920
Don't do that.

19:20.790 --> 19:21.920
He needs to rest now,

19:21.960 --> 19:22.890
since he's weak.

19:24.240 --> 19:25.000
Just tell him

19:25.680 --> 19:26.790
Fu Yixiao has left.

19:26.960 --> 19:27.310
But...

19:27.310 --> 19:28.640
This is the best solution now.

19:28.640 --> 19:30.040
It helps him recuperate.

19:36.030 --> 19:37.430
There's one more option.

19:38.030 --> 19:39.430
Maybe we can give it a try.

19:43.160 --> 19:44.020
Your Highness,

19:44.400 --> 19:46.270
given the poor blood flow in your legs,

19:46.270 --> 19:49.070
you should soak your feet
in warm water more often.

19:49.750 --> 19:50.610
Let me help you!

19:58.680 --> 20:00.790
It's just to bathe your feet.

20:01.160 --> 20:03.490
Why are you acting like a sulky housewife?

20:06.440 --> 20:08.240
It's much more comfortable barefoot.

20:08.240 --> 20:09.350
You should take your shoes off too.

20:09.350 --> 20:10.150
Take them off.

20:10.510 --> 20:12.040
Alright. I can do it myself.

20:12.070 --> 20:13.670
You just fell into the water,

20:13.680 --> 20:14.070
yet you are

20:14.070 --> 20:15.930
acting like a sulking housewife.

20:25.960 --> 20:26.550
Remember to put

20:26.550 --> 20:27.790
plenty of spices on the roast meat.

20:27.790 --> 20:29.200
You like spicy food, don't you?

20:29.200 --> 20:30.600
The spicier, the better.

20:30.680 --> 20:32.920
Besides spicy food,
you also enjoy drinking.

20:32.920 --> 20:34.160
Aside from garlic,

20:34.310 --> 20:35.640
you're not picky at all.

20:39.350 --> 20:40.080
Here you are.

20:41.720 --> 20:43.200
Isn't it too spicy to be put in my mouth?

20:43.200 --> 20:44.130
I'll eat it then.

20:49.960 --> 20:51.070
I see in no one but you

20:51.070 --> 20:51.920
the quality of a wolf,

20:51.920 --> 20:53.500
just like that in myself.

20:53.590 --> 20:54.450
Your Highness,

20:54.510 --> 20:55.770
I want you to have this.

20:55.960 --> 20:57.400
It symbolizes we'll stick together

20:57.400 --> 20:58.800
for the rest of our lives.

21:03.000 --> 21:04.200
This is the first time

21:05.000 --> 21:06.860
I have ever given a gift to a woman.

21:07.200 --> 21:08.400
You cannot refuse it.

21:11.030 --> 21:12.560
have you ever thought about

21:12.720 --> 21:14.580
what kind of man you want to marry?

21:17.350 --> 21:18.550
What's this stuff?

21:25.160 --> 21:25.960
A little wolf.

21:26.000 --> 21:26.750
I'll get Elder Zhou here

21:26.750 --> 21:27.610
to check on you.

21:27.830 --> 21:28.750
What do you need him for?

21:28.750 --> 21:30.410
He can't make wolf figurines.

21:36.680 --> 21:37.480
Your Majesty,

21:38.030 --> 21:39.360
Feng Pingcheng is dead.

21:39.400 --> 21:41.400
The Murong family has yielded real power.

21:41.400 --> 21:43.310
The rule of the new Emperor of Susha
is yet to be consolidated.

21:43.310 --> 21:43.960
Besides,

21:44.310 --> 21:45.710
with Feng Suige's death,

21:45.960 --> 21:47.960
the Susha Army has been left leaderless.

21:47.960 --> 21:49.550
I suggest we send troops

21:50.160 --> 21:51.490
straight to Yujing now.

21:53.110 --> 21:53.910
Your Majesty,

21:54.000 --> 21:54.660
at present,

21:54.790 --> 21:56.640
Jinxiu has a marriage alliance with Susha.

21:56.640 --> 21:58.590
The Princess of Susha
is still in Shengjing.

21:58.590 --> 21:59.880
If we declare war on them now,

21:59.880 --> 22:01.240
all our previous efforts,

22:01.240 --> 22:02.550
including
the Prince of Zhennan's marriage,

22:02.550 --> 22:03.960
will be in vain.

22:04.440 --> 22:06.370
Please reconsider, Your Majesty.

22:06.440 --> 22:07.110
What now?

22:07.880 --> 22:10.310
Since when do you take interest in
major affairs concerning the state

22:10.310 --> 22:12.110
and the military,
Minister of Imperial Stables?

22:12.110 --> 22:13.720
Now that Her Majesty has summoned

22:13.720 --> 22:15.270
us officials for consultations,

22:15.270 --> 22:17.640
I have no reason to hold back my opinions.

22:18.000 --> 22:20.230
What's more, if you are to start a war,

22:20.400 --> 22:23.200
won't you need the assistance
of the Imperial Stables?

22:23.200 --> 22:24.130
Stop bickering.

22:25.030 --> 22:25.830
Wang Encheng,

22:26.270 --> 22:26.880
answer me.

22:27.720 --> 22:28.920
What strategy

22:29.480 --> 22:31.740
do you have in mind for conquering Susha?

22:32.350 --> 22:33.150
Your Majesty,

22:33.750 --> 22:35.200
Jinxiu and Susha

22:35.270 --> 22:36.670
have been fighting each other for years.

22:36.670 --> 22:37.720
Our troops are well-trained

22:37.720 --> 22:39.000
with sufficient supplies.

22:39.000 --> 22:41.440
So, it's not hard
to mobilize the entire army.

22:41.440 --> 22:42.240
There is also a general

22:42.240 --> 22:43.240
standing ready for a war—

22:43.240 --> 22:45.030
the Prince of Zhennan.

22:46.110 --> 22:47.270
All that talking just proves

22:47.270 --> 22:48.790
you're trying to
have the Prince of Zhennan

22:48.790 --> 22:50.110
relocated to Pingling again!

22:50.110 --> 22:51.480
The Prince of Zhennan spent many years

22:51.480 --> 22:52.810
stationing at Pingling

22:53.000 --> 22:54.860
and defending Jinxiu's borders.

22:55.000 --> 22:56.510
What's wrong with recommending

22:56.510 --> 22:58.030
His Highness lead the troops?

22:58.030 --> 22:58.830
Your Majesty,

22:59.070 --> 23:00.750
the Prince of Zhennan was appointed
to marry the Princess of Susha,

23:00.750 --> 23:02.350
but he fled and came back
without permission.

23:02.350 --> 23:03.960
This matter hasn't been settled yet.

23:03.960 --> 23:05.550
If he is designated as the commander,

23:05.550 --> 23:07.750
I'm afraid
people won't accept his authority.

23:07.750 --> 23:08.510
You're only doing this

23:08.510 --> 23:09.750
to give everyone a hard time!

23:09.750 --> 23:10.950
This is pure slander!

23:10.960 --> 23:11.420
Enough!

23:12.590 --> 23:13.720
No more squabbling.

23:16.030 --> 23:17.240
Attacking Susha

23:17.510 --> 23:18.640
is a serious issue.

23:19.440 --> 23:21.100
Let's discuss it another day.

23:22.830 --> 23:23.510
Yes.

23:23.920 --> 23:24.720
You may leave.

23:29.680 --> 23:31.500
All these political disputes

23:31.640 --> 23:33.350
can't be easily settled.

23:34.160 --> 23:36.720
The Emperor and I
don't see eye to eye now.

23:37.310 --> 23:38.440
The most urgent task

23:38.550 --> 23:40.070
is to gain control of Xia Jingshi.

23:40.070 --> 23:42.400
His help is needed to stabilize the court.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.400
God knows when that old punk

23:48.400 --> 23:49.590
Wang Encheng latched onto

23:49.590 --> 23:50.850
the Prince of Zhennan.

23:51.160 --> 23:52.640
He tried to persuade the Empress Dowager

23:52.640 --> 23:54.550
to let the prince return to Pingling

23:54.550 --> 23:56.280
and lead troops against Susha.

24:03.830 --> 24:05.090
Where is Bai Shouzhuo?

24:05.720 --> 24:06.510
Where is he?

24:19.880 --> 24:21.140
You dare not look at me.

24:21.960 --> 24:22.590
Why?

24:23.000 --> 24:25.060
This humble servant dares not offend

24:25.440 --> 24:26.840
the Princess of Zhennan.

24:27.350 --> 24:28.810
What Princess of Zhennan?

24:29.310 --> 24:30.960
Princess Xiyang and the Prince of Zhennan

24:30.960 --> 24:32.890
have broken off their engagement.

24:33.270 --> 24:34.240
From now on,

24:34.640 --> 24:37.160
those who dare to
call her Princess of Zhennan

24:37.160 --> 24:37.640
again

24:38.640 --> 24:40.240
will be heavily punished by me!

24:40.240 --> 24:40.790
As

24:41.480 --> 24:42.810
Your Majesty commands.

24:44.680 --> 24:45.400
Alright.

24:46.030 --> 24:47.030
Stop being angry.

24:47.480 --> 24:48.210
Come with me.

24:49.400 --> 24:50.510
I picked some flowers for you.

24:50.510 --> 24:51.070
Take a look.

24:51.070 --> 24:52.600
See if there's any you like.

25:07.000 --> 25:07.920
I like this one.

25:09.720 --> 25:10.510
This one?

25:11.350 --> 25:12.410
This one's no good.

25:12.880 --> 25:14.440
T-Those are better.

25:14.440 --> 25:15.400
You don't like them?

25:15.400 --> 25:16.330
Put it in my hair.

25:34.310 --> 25:34.790
Get out!

25:37.110 --> 25:37.920
Everyone out!

25:49.880 --> 25:50.880
How odd it is.

25:51.640 --> 25:52.590
This flower

25:52.880 --> 25:54.540
is clearly withered and worn,

25:54.750 --> 25:56.350
yet when placed in your hair,

25:56.880 --> 25:57.440
it looks prettier

25:57.440 --> 25:59.100
than anything I've ever seen.

25:59.550 --> 26:01.810
Were you talking about attacking Susha?

26:07.400 --> 26:08.880
Are you worried about Susha

26:08.880 --> 26:09.960
or Xia Jingshi?

26:11.440 --> 26:12.270
Listen up,

26:12.590 --> 26:13.480
there's no way

26:13.480 --> 26:14.920
I'll let him

26:15.310 --> 26:16.170
out of my sight.

26:17.750 --> 26:19.110
I only care about Susha.

26:19.830 --> 26:22.090
Have you really decided to attack Susha?

26:23.480 --> 26:24.480
Princess of Susha,

26:24.480 --> 26:25.340
you're getting

26:25.750 --> 26:26.960
bolder and bolder.

26:30.590 --> 26:31.640
Pour me a drink.

26:58.590 --> 27:00.500
I can never stay mad at you.

27:01.070 --> 27:02.310
No matter what you do,

27:02.720 --> 27:03.830
as long as I see you,

27:04.750 --> 27:06.350
I'd feel much more cheerful.

27:08.960 --> 27:09.720
Tell me.

27:10.480 --> 27:11.410
What do you want?

27:12.440 --> 27:14.830
Who will lead the Jinxiu army
to attack Susha?

27:14.830 --> 27:16.090
Will it be Xia Jingshi?

27:18.350 --> 27:19.880
He'd love that to happen.

27:20.680 --> 27:22.440
He has colluded with a bunch of officials

27:22.440 --> 27:24.400
and made them lobby the Empress Dowager.

27:24.400 --> 27:25.110
Does he think

27:25.110 --> 27:26.970
I don't know he's behind all that?

27:27.400 --> 27:29.330
I won't give him the satisfaction.

27:29.350 --> 27:30.950
He lives in Rongyang Palace.

27:32.110 --> 27:33.110
How did he get in contact

27:33.110 --> 27:34.370
with those officials?

27:57.640 --> 27:58.750
Settle down.

28:00.550 --> 28:01.750
Clear your mind.

28:04.310 --> 28:05.240
Do as I say.

28:05.790 --> 28:06.590
Relax.

28:09.160 --> 28:10.200
Breathe.

28:12.000 --> 28:13.070
Relax...

28:15.310 --> 28:16.400
Breathe...

28:29.350 --> 28:30.350
This voice...

28:31.480 --> 28:33.140
Why does it sound so familiar?

28:46.750 --> 28:48.240
Greetings, Mother.

28:49.480 --> 28:50.140
Take a seat.

28:53.270 --> 28:53.920
This apricot soup

28:53.920 --> 28:55.480
was freshly made today.

28:55.960 --> 28:56.750
Try some.

28:59.110 --> 29:01.110
Ever since I was little, I've always

29:01.590 --> 29:03.990
remembered you like apricot soup, Mother.

29:04.030 --> 29:05.440
What a good son you are,

29:06.400 --> 29:08.400
for remembering such a tiny detail.

29:14.200 --> 29:15.530
What happened, Mother?

29:15.790 --> 29:17.590
Who has upset you?

29:19.110 --> 29:20.750
It's been a long time

29:21.750 --> 29:23.590
since you married the Princess of Susha.

29:23.590 --> 29:24.160
Mother,

29:25.160 --> 29:27.760
she and I have never
consummated our marriage.

29:28.270 --> 29:28.880
Now,

29:29.440 --> 29:31.640
we're not even husband and wife in name.

29:31.750 --> 29:33.150
Everything that happens

29:33.270 --> 29:35.070
in this palace is no secret to me.

29:36.160 --> 29:37.110
I refrain from saying

29:37.110 --> 29:39.590
certain things
so as to preserve your dignity.

29:39.590 --> 29:41.200
But I'm perfectly aware

29:41.750 --> 29:43.720
that it must make you feel uncomfortable

29:43.720 --> 29:45.720
when she gets closer to the Emperor.

29:46.680 --> 29:48.540
I've met that girl several times.

29:48.880 --> 29:49.830
She's spoiled.

29:50.160 --> 29:51.290
High-maintenance.

29:52.230 --> 29:54.350
You must have suffered quite a lot.

29:54.790 --> 29:55.590
Let me ask you.

29:56.200 --> 29:58.000
What are you going to do with her?

29:59.350 --> 30:00.280
I'm thinking...

30:00.880 --> 30:02.480
since she's not my wife anymore,

30:02.480 --> 30:04.440
maybe we should send her back to Susha.

30:04.440 --> 30:05.090
You fool!

30:05.880 --> 30:07.860
Her father and brother are dead now.

30:07.860 --> 30:09.460
What can she do back in Susha?

30:10.880 --> 30:12.160
She's like this fan.

30:12.960 --> 30:14.510
On hot summer days,

30:14.720 --> 30:15.680
it's of some use.

30:16.470 --> 30:18.270
But once the weather turns cold,

30:20.210 --> 30:21.500
it becomes useless.

30:25.880 --> 30:27.640
I consider you my own child.

30:29.000 --> 30:30.110
You've been upset.

30:30.270 --> 30:31.640
I'll stand up for you..

30:32.640 --> 30:33.640
What do you think?

30:40.000 --> 30:40.590
Do

30:42.110 --> 30:43.370
as you see fit, Mother.

30:44.880 --> 30:46.830
Xiyang has misplaced her efforts.

30:47.790 --> 30:50.160
Even the Emperor
has been influenced by her.

30:50.160 --> 30:50.960
Don't bother yourself

30:50.960 --> 30:52.270
with matters about her.

30:52.270 --> 30:53.200
Leave them to me.

30:55.110 --> 30:55.750
Also,

30:56.240 --> 30:57.270
there's one more thing

30:57.270 --> 30:58.530
I need to ask you about.

30:58.590 --> 31:00.450
The court of Susha is in chaos now.

31:00.750 --> 31:02.960
This is the perfect timing
to launch an attack.

31:02.960 --> 31:04.560
It's a good opportunity for Jinxiu,

31:04.560 --> 31:05.810
and more so for you.

31:06.400 --> 31:08.160
Would you like to be
a military commander again

31:08.160 --> 31:09.960
and to fight on the battlefield?

31:20.030 --> 31:20.590
I promise

31:21.090 --> 31:23.150
I won't be a disappointment, Mother.

31:24.400 --> 31:24.960
Good.

31:27.830 --> 31:28.510
Mr. Gao!

31:39.680 --> 31:41.200
I am very concerned

31:41.790 --> 31:43.310
about your health.

31:43.750 --> 31:45.270
When you conquer Susha,

31:45.920 --> 31:46.940
I'll find

31:47.160 --> 31:48.560
a good physician for you.

32:01.720 --> 32:02.780
Thank you, Mother.

32:42.290 --> 32:43.570
[IIIII]

32:47.520 --> 32:50.190
[IIIII]

32:54.640 --> 32:56.550
Those lines were carved by Huang.

32:58.310 --> 32:58.920
Lady An,

32:59.440 --> 33:00.590
what brings you here?

33:00.590 --> 33:02.350
This morning, Ling Feng came to see me.

33:02.350 --> 33:03.440
That old man

33:03.480 --> 33:04.530
made a bet with me.

33:04.640 --> 33:05.590
He doesn't believe

33:05.590 --> 33:06.830
I can cure Feng Suige's

33:06.830 --> 33:07.880
amnesia.

33:08.160 --> 33:09.440
He said if Feng Suige could

33:09.440 --> 33:10.550
get all the memories back,

33:10.550 --> 33:11.270
he would give me

33:11.270 --> 33:12.440
Zhengnian Villa.

33:15.310 --> 33:17.200
I don't care for his villa.

33:18.350 --> 33:20.200
Ling Feng told me the story

33:20.200 --> 33:21.400
of you and Feng Suige.

33:21.440 --> 33:23.140
Now, I'm just seeking a cure

33:23.270 --> 33:24.070
for Feng Suige,

33:24.070 --> 33:25.550
and also for your sake.

33:25.790 --> 33:26.920
I wish for you two

33:26.960 --> 33:28.350
to spend the rest

33:28.480 --> 33:29.920
of your lives together.

33:30.960 --> 33:32.020
Thank you, Lady An.

33:33.110 --> 33:35.330
In the past, every time I came here,

33:35.440 --> 33:37.700
Huang would be sticking around the tree.

33:38.240 --> 33:40.240
He's also an unfortunate man.

33:40.550 --> 33:42.040
Lord Ling told me

33:42.270 --> 33:43.350
that you saved

33:43.480 --> 33:44.480
Huang's life too.

33:44.750 --> 33:46.190
I did save his life,

33:46.240 --> 33:47.700
but he forgot everything.

33:47.920 --> 33:48.920
He can't remember

33:48.960 --> 33:50.960
about himself and his wife.

33:50.960 --> 33:52.070
He has a wife?

33:52.640 --> 33:54.240
How come I've never seen her?

33:54.400 --> 33:55.510
Huang always sits here alone,

33:55.510 --> 33:56.720
all by himself.

33:57.350 --> 33:58.920
His wife passed away.

33:59.110 --> 34:01.160
When she was gathering herbs for Huang
in the mountain,

34:01.160 --> 34:02.790
a venomous snake bit her.

34:03.160 --> 34:04.350
By the time someone found her,

34:04.350 --> 34:05.310
she had died.

34:05.590 --> 34:07.750
She took this very path to the mountain.

34:07.750 --> 34:09.440
After her passing,

34:10.190 --> 34:11.670
Huang would come and spend time

34:11.670 --> 34:12.840
under this tree every day,

34:12.260 --> 34:13.710
[IIIII]

34:13.000 --> 34:13.960
rain or shine.

34:14.150 --> 34:15.590
Nobody knows why.

34:18.440 --> 34:21.510
[IIIII]

34:24.800 --> 34:25.590
Does he...

34:25.760 --> 34:27.760
keep track of time with these lines?

34:34.420 --> 34:38.219
[IIIII]

34:38.630 --> 34:39.710
You're right.

34:40.000 --> 34:41.960
There are about 60 groups of such lines,

34:41.960 --> 34:43.670
totalling over 300 strokes.

34:43.960 --> 34:45.280
If I remember correctly,

34:45.280 --> 34:47.190
his wife died 10 months ago.

34:47.670 --> 34:49.070
That was about 300 days.

34:49.440 --> 34:49.880
It means

34:49.880 --> 34:51.590
Huang carves a line each day,

34:52.000 --> 34:52.630
to mark

34:52.840 --> 34:55.280
how long it has been since his wife left.

35:00.800 --> 35:02.400
Huang hasn't forgotten her.

35:02.760 --> 35:04.420
He always remembers his wife.

35:04.590 --> 35:05.990
He lingers here every day

35:06.190 --> 35:07.150
in the hope of seeing

35:07.150 --> 35:08.210
his wife come back.

35:11.130 --> 35:13.940
[IIIII]

35:11.230 --> 35:12.000
Right.

35:12.550 --> 35:14.280
Love is deeply engraved in one's heart.

35:14.280 --> 35:15.110
Love can't be

35:15.110 --> 35:16.170
easily forgotten.

35:18.710 --> 35:19.360
Lady An,

35:19.800 --> 35:20.660
I don't believe

35:20.920 --> 35:21.960
Feng Suige would

35:22.000 --> 35:23.330
easily forget about me.

35:23.480 --> 35:25.230
I must still have a place
in his heart.

35:25.230 --> 35:25.760
I firmly

35:25.760 --> 35:27.160
believe he remembers me.

35:27.510 --> 35:28.320
I don't have to

35:28.320 --> 35:29.670
disappear from his life.

35:29.670 --> 35:30.960
There must be other ways

35:30.960 --> 35:32.020
to remind him of me.

35:33.360 --> 35:35.070
Let me think about it.

35:39.900 --> 35:40.100
[Liu Xinglan]

35:40.260 --> 35:42.250
[Shen Wu] [Wang Lang]

35:45.670 --> 35:47.000
This contains the information

35:47.000 --> 35:49.010
of all the civil and military officials
of Susha.

35:49.010 --> 35:55.420
[Diligence and Care for the People]

35:49.280 --> 35:50.400
The Empress Dowager asked me

35:50.400 --> 35:52.190
to carefully study this document,

35:52.190 --> 35:53.360
and to decide which of these officials

35:53.360 --> 35:55.290
are worth establishing ties with.

35:55.960 --> 35:57.550
After all, I've just ascended the throne.

35:57.550 --> 35:59.360
My rule has not been consolidated yet.

35:59.360 --> 36:01.690
I need the assistance of loyal officials.

36:01.960 --> 36:04.000
What's your opinion, Minister Shen?

36:04.000 --> 36:04.960
Your Majesty is

36:05.280 --> 36:06.000
absolutely

36:06.510 --> 36:07.280
correct.

36:07.550 --> 36:08.590
Then who do you think

36:08.590 --> 36:09.760
I should bond with?

36:10.920 --> 36:13.290
-I lack the wit to...
-I'll pick you then.

36:13.760 --> 36:14.760
What do you think?

36:15.440 --> 36:16.230
I...

36:16.290 --> 36:19.110
[Diligence and Care for the People]

36:17.230 --> 36:19.550
thank Your Majesty
for giving me this honor.

36:19.550 --> 36:21.030
Not so quick.

36:21.440 --> 36:22.800
Aren't you curious

36:23.000 --> 36:24.150
why I chose you?

36:25.400 --> 36:26.530
This humble servant

36:26.590 --> 36:27.850
implores Your Majesty

36:28.070 --> 36:29.070
to enlighten him.

36:29.320 --> 36:31.030
After spending over a decade
working in the court,

36:31.030 --> 36:33.090
you've become an expert in politics.

36:33.110 --> 36:35.320
You're also good at
flattering and pleasing others.

36:35.320 --> 36:36.920
You should have held great power

36:36.920 --> 36:38.800
and become a key official of Susha.

36:38.800 --> 36:40.600
But you have a particular habit—

36:40.920 --> 36:43.190
you only curry favor
with those who are influential

36:43.190 --> 36:44.230
without truly submitting yourself

36:44.230 --> 36:45.320
or pledging loyalty

36:45.320 --> 36:46.280
to them.

36:47.670 --> 36:48.960
That's why though you can't be

36:48.960 --> 36:50.620
anyone's trusted confidant,

36:51.000 --> 36:53.130
you can still live a comfortable life.

36:53.190 --> 36:55.050
Even when the Zhuang family fell,

36:55.510 --> 36:57.000
and many were implicated,

36:57.630 --> 36:59.760
you managed to stay out and unscathed.

37:00.760 --> 37:02.150
I'm so sorry.

37:02.630 --> 37:03.190
Alright.

37:04.880 --> 37:06.230
I'm giving you a chance

37:06.670 --> 37:08.190
to work as my confidant.

37:08.630 --> 37:09.560
Are you onboard?

37:10.360 --> 37:11.510
But I've already been

37:11.510 --> 37:12.880
Your Majesty's confidant this entire time.

37:12.880 --> 37:14.440
Everything I have belongs to Susha

37:14.440 --> 37:15.960
and was given by Your Majesty.

37:15.960 --> 37:17.150
I'm showing much sincerity here.

37:17.150 --> 37:18.550
Stop patronizing me,

37:18.960 --> 37:19.820
Minister Shen,

37:20.630 --> 37:21.960
or I'll make you retire.

37:23.480 --> 37:25.800
I'm glad to be Your Majesty's confidant

37:25.920 --> 37:28.320
and loyal servant till my last breath.

37:29.230 --> 37:29.800
Good.

37:31.400 --> 37:33.280
The first task I assign you

37:34.400 --> 37:37.260
is to find out
the cause of death of the late Emperor.

37:39.840 --> 37:40.960
But, Your Majesty,

37:41.360 --> 37:42.490
it's been made clear

37:42.760 --> 37:45.190
that the late Emperor
was murdered by the First Prince.

37:45.190 --> 37:47.280
It is known to all.

37:48.320 --> 37:50.190
I'm asking for the truth.

38:03.510 --> 38:04.910
You're recovering well.

38:05.110 --> 38:06.670
Fortunately, you're strong enough

38:06.670 --> 38:08.530
to survive such severe injuries.

38:08.880 --> 38:10.210
Elder Zhou, Lu Ke told me

38:10.510 --> 38:11.650
that you went to great lengths

38:11.650 --> 38:12.750
to save my life.

38:13.030 --> 38:14.030
I'll never forget

38:14.550 --> 38:15.880
this tremendous favor.

38:16.000 --> 38:16.600
Not at all.

38:17.480 --> 38:17.920
Zhou,

38:18.510 --> 38:19.670
have you figured out a way

38:19.670 --> 38:20.920
to cure his amnesia?

38:22.400 --> 38:23.660
No medicine will work.

38:24.280 --> 38:24.960
At the moment,

38:24.960 --> 38:26.490
I can't think of a solution.

38:37.960 --> 38:39.020
All of you, get out.

38:43.000 --> 38:44.460
I'm telling you to get out.

38:45.190 --> 38:47.250
This matter only concerns him and me.

38:48.480 --> 38:49.480
Your Highness...

38:51.440 --> 38:52.300
Leave the room.

38:59.670 --> 39:01.130
Keep calm, Your Highness.

39:36.190 --> 39:38.280
Lu Ke told me you had left.

39:39.920 --> 39:41.520
Why did you suddenly go away?

39:44.000 --> 39:44.670
Because...

39:45.440 --> 39:46.840
I didn't want to hurt you.

39:47.840 --> 39:50.070
Then why did you come back?

39:51.480 --> 39:52.140
Because...

39:53.440 --> 39:54.360
I missed you.

39:55.000 --> 39:55.630
Back off!

39:58.920 --> 40:00.710
I heard from Lu Ke and Ling Feng

40:02.960 --> 40:04.820
that I had forgotten many things.

40:05.400 --> 40:06.000
They said

40:06.000 --> 40:08.070
you were the love of my life.

40:08.800 --> 40:09.320
I am.

40:14.190 --> 40:16.230
But nothing they say

40:17.800 --> 40:19.150
can erase the memory

40:19.190 --> 40:20.850
of you shooting an arrow at me.

40:23.590 --> 40:26.190
How am I supposed to believe
all of this is true?

40:26.760 --> 40:28.220
Feng Suige, you know what?

40:29.360 --> 40:30.620
I used to deeply regret

40:31.670 --> 40:33.440
shooting that arrow at you

40:34.670 --> 40:36.270
and nearly ending your life.

40:37.550 --> 40:39.280
But now I'm feeling grateful.

40:40.550 --> 40:42.550
I'm grateful for that arrow attack,

40:42.840 --> 40:44.570
since it makes you remember me.

40:47.190 --> 40:48.880
Of course I remember you.

40:49.840 --> 40:51.800
You were the Red-Clad General of Jinxiu,

40:51.800 --> 40:52.760
Fu Yixiao.

40:55.030 --> 40:55.550
Yes.

40:56.280 --> 40:58.400
You were my sworn enemy.

40:58.840 --> 40:59.400
Yes.

41:00.150 --> 41:02.590
We fiercely fought against
each other on the battlefield,

41:02.590 --> 41:03.480
resorting to every means

41:03.480 --> 41:04.940
to take each other's life.

41:05.510 --> 41:06.150
Yes.

41:06.800 --> 41:08.400
Then how do you explain this?

41:09.840 --> 41:11.920
How did you become the love of my life?

41:12.960 --> 41:14.220
It can't be explained.

41:15.070 --> 41:16.670
And it needs no explanation.

41:18.760 --> 41:20.020
We simply fell in love.

41:22.070 --> 41:23.670
There was no reason for that.

41:29.440 --> 41:30.500
But I don't recall.

41:31.440 --> 41:33.840
It has just temporarily slipped your mind.

41:34.400 --> 41:35.110
Feng Suige,

41:36.710 --> 41:38.310
do you really want to kill me?

41:47.940 --> 41:50.130
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

41:48.800 --> 41:49.660
You hesitated.

41:50.670 --> 41:53.550
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

41:52.880 --> 41:54.400
There's already an answer in your heart.

41:54.060 --> 41:56.100
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

41:55.360 --> 41:56.620
You just wouldn't say it out.

41:56.620 --> 42:00.170
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

41:57.230 --> 41:57.710
Right?

42:00.590 --> 42:02.830
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

42:00.760 --> 42:02.110
Don't ever think

42:02.110 --> 42:03.360
I won't kill you.

42:03.260 --> 42:06.420
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

42:06.680 --> 42:12.910
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

42:12.000 --> 42:13.060
What are you doing?

42:14.880 --> 42:15.590
Feng Suige,

42:15.960 --> 42:18.900
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

42:17.230 --> 42:18.230
I've promised

42:19.590 --> 42:20.880
to never leave you,

42:21.190 --> 42:22.650
no matter what may happen.

42:22.670 --> 42:25.510
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

42:24.480 --> 42:25.630
If you want me dead,

42:26.050 --> 42:29.080
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

42:27.590 --> 42:28.790
I'll forsake my life.

42:29.420 --> 42:31.990
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

42:32.220 --> 42:35.340
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

42:35.710 --> 42:38.350
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪
